-- A real quiz bank for all 26 units.
--
-- The shipped bank had 36 rows but only 8 distinct questions: units 1-2
-- had six genuine ones, units 3-17 shared two placeholders, and units
-- 18-26 had none at all. The placeholders are removed and every unit now
-- has five questions written against its actual content.
--
-- Five per unit matters: the pass mark is 60%, so 3 of 5 passes cleanly.

-- Remove the two generic placeholders wherever they appear.
DELETE FROM public.quiz_questions
WHERE question IN (
  'What is a good practice when learning a new unit?',
  'Which best describes the focus of this unit?'
);

